        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana KR119, Solid Brass 1-1/4\" Decorative Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis small cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes mounting hardware for easy installation. It brings a touch of classic hardware decor to any desk, cabinet door, furniture piece, or drawer. Made out of solid brass, it is available in 9 different finishes. No matter which finish you choose, the handle will still be made from high quality, solid brass. The 1-1/4 Inch Decorative Cabinet Knob has a 1-1/8 inch projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KR119-Specifications.gif?v=1704354706\" width=\"510\" height=\"156\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana KR119 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative cabinet knob can be combined with either the <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-cabinet-knob-1-inch-decorative-base-plate-deltana-bprc100\"><b>1\" Decorative Base Plate</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-cabinet-knob-1-1-2-inch-decorative-base-plate-deltana-bprc150\"><b>1-1/2\" Decorative Base Plate</b></a> for those who love traditional style. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana KR119 Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KR119.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana KR119 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
