                "title": "1-1/4 Inch Decorative Cabinet Knob | Deltana KR119",
                "description": "Solid Brass 1-1/4 Inch Decorative Cabinet Knob Deltana KR119 - This small cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes mounting hardware for easy installation. It brings a touch of classic hardware decor to any desk, cabinet door, furniture piece, or drawer. Made out of solid brass, it is available in 9 different finishes. No matter which finish you choose, the handle will still be made from high quality, solid brass. The 1-1/4 Inch Decorative Cabinet Knob has a 1-1/8 inch projection.\r\n",
